model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Bulk metadata import accepts only the recorded pool owner through the typed owner-session route. Host policy transactions finish before backend calls; a signed short-lived callback rechecks current ownership, organization membership and app-management permission before every chunk. Upload never approves execution. Exact descriptor and canonical map digests bind approval, source identities and attribution. The dedicated EU job uses immutable EU record-storage chunks, fresh scoped Home row locks and additive model-history v6 job/receipt tables. Each chunk commits records and its exact replay receipt together, pauses without fresh external guard evidence, and rejects changed retained contents. It changes no dependency or pin."
    }
  }
}
